    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">Metronom works entirely on this phone. It has no internet access and collects no data. Your songs, setlists and settings are plain files in the app\'s private folder, and the only files that leave it are the zips you export yourself. If Android\'s device backup is switched on in your phone\'s settings, Android itself may copy that folder to your Google account when it backs up the phone; the app takes no part in that.</string>
